{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0344_1000_043nor", "source_sha256": "9b785c2f797df554756cbe7b2362a5173314c5c2aabb51a0ade0e551432842c7", "ja": "うんうん、いい感じ！　ふふっ♪", "zh": "嗯嗯，感觉不错！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0344_1001_p", "source_sha256": "fdf918ec38944b607681155dc7195076ec47fc4871c0848780f7a9d3e20a4d29", "ja": "お疲れさま、のり子。\n新しい衣装はどうだ？", "zh": "辛苦了，法子。\n新衣服感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0344_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "1ad9ec5cdf95e6e1737447dd2e796c5f704af3377b615b02e8b6b6820a6da653", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nすっごく動きやすくて、いい感じだね。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n特别好活动，感觉很不错呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0344_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "e942fda094c5e91a3fac401daf00ae6c1a784e2abd90b15910c8c15a64e8f3f7", "ja": "セクシーだけどかっこいいし、気合いが入るって\nいうか！　この衣装ならリングでも戦えそう！", "zh": "虽然性感，但也很帅气，让人干劲十足！穿着这身服装，感觉就算上擂台也能战斗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0344_1004_p", "source_sha256": "94d6a3b2c95908f0d7e118a7f91343e6622150c9cad361220aea1aaa25f1bf12", "ja": "ああ、確かに！　公演で使うイメージだったけど、\nプロレスのリングにも合うかもな。", "zh": "啊，确实！本来是想象着在公演中使用的，不过说不定也很适合职业摔跤擂台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0344_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "54d21c92ebf10649bcd34986233cf915f2948b66db1b3cae1b29119024493827", "ja": "でしょ！　いつも衣装は勝負服だと思ってるけど……\nこの衣装は、特にやるぞ～！って気持ちになるよ。", "zh": "对吧！我一直都把演出服当成决胜服……但这套服装尤其让人产生“要上了～！”的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0344_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "e0264e909ea858a30cab579b9fe23b4c387c633e703bdbd1bbcc56835cccdef0", "ja": "ねえ……もしアタシが戦うなら、相手は誰だろう？\nやっぱり、他の事務所のアイドルとか？", "zh": "喂……如果我要战斗的话，对手会是谁呢？\n果然是其他事务所的偶像之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0344_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3e927f1b3d5409debd1433c854eec553631f4a631022a6500608a8f66a1d0fd5", "ja": "アイドルとしてってことなら、他のアイドルも\nそうだけど……劇場のみんなもそうじゃないか？", "zh": "如果是指作为偶像的话，其他偶像也是如此……不过，剧场里的大家不也是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0344_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "b40e26fd5dd39568ee3c6e34c96dee8f8265dbca65a1808e0c502ea236942294", "ja": "確かに。みんなとは仲間だけどライバルだもんね。\nうん……強敵ぞろいで、すっごく楽しそう！", "zh": "确实。大家既是伙伴，也是对手嘛。\n嗯……强敌如云，感觉超带劲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0344_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "466bda1194adceb3c5aaed8b412be4da0e786f93b381815e1e57683115814348", "ja": "今のアタシで、劇場の一番になれるかな……？\nみんなに勝って、自分にも勝ちたい！", "zh": "凭现在的我，能成为剧场第一吗……？\n我想战胜大家，也战胜自己！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0344_1010_p", "source_sha256": "345d4efdb04059cf9b93fc44abbd30e05d853a910124d29c0ede880a437089ed", "ja": "自分にも、か……なるほど。\n一番の敵は自分だって言うもんな。", "zh": "连自己也是吗……原来如此。都说最大的敌人就是自己嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0344_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "48cdef12b85ef1ab53d4439895997da15fedaaaa498075101c859e212f882ada", "ja": "そうそう！　技をうまく決めるのも、\n緊張に打ち勝つのも、全部自分との戦いだからね！", "zh": "没错没错！无论是顺利使出招式，还是战胜紧张情绪，全都是与自己战斗，所以嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0344_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c0cad3871c12c0384fdca5717788d0ee802589f0d73edcbf3fd4a18fed168c13", "ja": "そうだな。かなりの強敵だけど、\nこの衣装を着たのり子なら、きっと勝てると思うよ。", "zh": "是啊。虽然是相当强的对手，但我觉得穿上这身服装的纪子一定能赢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0344_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "6963f00c8f04e95c57e3480ef7a9db6fc3cd2fa8c18e18c642f1f6c5f8964899", "ja": "そ、そう？　……{$P$}に\nそう言ってもらえると、すごい自信になるよ。", "zh": "这、这样吗？……能听到{$P$}这么说，\n真的让我信心大增。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0344_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "a5ec323252abad8b083e3bff2f372e6a4d360878beb479ccee144e9a1a3e66e6", "ja": "衣装の力も借りるけど、アタシ自身も努力しないとね。\nだって、やっぱり頼りになるのは自分の力だから！", "zh": "虽然也会借助服装的力量，但我自己也得努力才行。毕竟，真正能依靠的还是自己的力量嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0344_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "e222d6a3a9bb6d6499a8c9fe4d846d4ca371ecfdca41fe73108ea1ceed3b5646", "ja": "く～っ、なんか燃えてきたー！　ね、レッスンルーム\nって空いてるかな？　今から練習したいんだけど……。", "zh": "哎～，感觉干劲都燃起来了！那个，练习室现在有空吗？我想马上去练习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0344_1016_p", "source_sha256": "7c05377cfa049ff3f7134da06f1f4c83f48a14508adbe284787cd10fb2cfc0cd", "ja": "ああ、誰も使ってないから、\nすぐに使えると思うぞ。", "zh": "啊，没人用，所以应该马上就能用了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0344_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "e67aad116ad9a285b50c5b1fe3567790a01bbd35c3407a81f11723f30fcaa7ea", "ja": "よかった！　じゃあ、アタシ着替えてくるね。\nふふっ。今日はどんな必殺技を練習しようかな～？", "zh": "太好了！那我去换衣服啦。\n呵呵，今天要练习什么必杀技好呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0344_1018_p", "source_sha256": "09c0e3e5eeda4f6f37102ee9c4cf4696e886b94053f89d35cd362165aab53276", "ja": "えっ！？　練習って、そっちの！？", "zh": "咦！？你说的练习，是那种练习吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0344_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "cb39756b576808c33bb35c886eda34a8d8e2847ef561ab8686ae9ff911eb05f5", "ja": "あははっ、冗談♪　ちゃんとアイドルのレッスン\nしてくるよ！　アタシがアタシに勝つために、ね♪", "zh": "啊哈哈，开玩笑的啦♪ 我会好好去参加偶像课程的！\n为了战胜我自己，对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
